---
const title = "冰箱里的世界";
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <style>
      * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
      
      body {
        font-family: "PingFang SC", "Hiragino Sans GB", "Microsoft YaHei", "Noto Sans SC", sans-serif;
        background: #0a0a0a;
        color: #e5e5e5;
        line-height: 1.8;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      
      .container {
        max-width: 720px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 2rem;
      }
      
      header {
        padding: 2rem 0;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }
      
      .logo {
        font-size: 1rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        color: #fff;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }
      
      .nav a {
        color: #888;
        text-decoration: none;
        margin-left: 2rem;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        transition: color 0.2s;
      }
      
      .nav a:hover {
        color: #fff;
      }
      
      .hero {
        padding: 8rem 0 4rem;
        text-align: center;
      }
      
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        color: #fff;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      }
      
      .hero p {
        font-size: 1rem;
        color: #666;
        max-width: 480px;
        margin: 0 auto;
      }
      
      .badge {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
        border: 1px solid #333;
        border-radius: 100px;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #888;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      }
      
      .cta {
        margin-top: 3rem;
      }
      
      .btn {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 0.875rem 2.5rem;
        background: #fff;
        color: #0a0a0a;
        text-decoration: none;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        font-weight: 500;
        transition: opacity 0.2s;
      }
      
      .btn:hover {
        opacity: 0.85;
      }
      
      .divider {
        height: 1px;
        background: #1a1a1a;
        margin: 4rem 0;
      }
      
      .section {
        padding: 2rem 0 6rem;
      }
      
      .section h2 {
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #555;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      
      .feature {
        padding: 1.5rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #111;
      }
      
      .feature:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
      }
      
      .feature h3 {
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        color: #fff;
        font-weight: 500;
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      
      .feature p {
        font-size: 0.875rem;
        color: #666;
      }
      
      footer {
        padding: 3rem 0;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.75rem;
        color: #333;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="container">
      <span class="logo">{title}</span>
      <nav class="nav">
        <a href="/login">登录</a>
        <a href="/register">注册</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
    
    <main>
      <div class="hero container">
        <h1>冰箱里的世界</h1>
        <p>一个私密的阅读空间。只有受邀者才能进入，在这里，文字是唯一的通行证。</p>
        <span class="badge">邀请制会员</span>
        <div class="cta">
          <a href="/register" class="btn">使用邀请码注册</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="divider"></div>
      
      <div class="section container">
        <h2>关于本站</h2>
        <div class="feature">
          <h3>私密阅读</h3>
          <p>仅限受邀会员访问，每一篇文字都是为你而写。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <h3>纯粹体验</h3>
          <p>无广告、无干扰，只有你和故事。</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <h3>持续更新</h3>
          <p>作者不定期更新章节，敬请期待。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    
    <footer class="container">
      <p>© 2026 {title} · 仅供会员阅读</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>